      "cooked": "<p>Hello Frappers…!</p>\n<p>I have a custom query report “serials”.  with columns Serial Number, Item Code, Sales Order, etc.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/b/9b30abbf259a202c165dbb20273f946f40324315.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9b30abbf259a202c165dbb20273f946f40324315\" title=\"report\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b30abbf259a202c165dbb20273f946f40324315_2_690x375.png\" alt=\"report\" data-base62-sha1=\"m8ShEOmx9ISjOdznHoMm9RtekIt\" width=\"690\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b30abbf259a202c165dbb20273f946f40324315_2_690x375.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b30abbf259a202c165dbb20273f946f40324315_2_1035x562.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b30abbf259a202c165dbb20273f946f40324315_2_1380x750.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E8E9E9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">report</span><span class=\"informations\">1527×830 110 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Then i have a doctype Quality Inspection. What i want is, When the sales order and item code is selected in the Quality inspection form, the field Serial Number Details must fetch all the serial numbers from report like “2509466 to 2509462” OR “2509466” (if only one entry) in the red boxed field. <strong>The fetched serial numbers must be relevant to each other as in the report.</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/d/7dd51e05b9298b901156364fdd86c2692f39f7c7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7dd51e05b9298b901156364fdd86c2692f39f7c7\" title=\"Qinsp\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7dd51e05b9298b901156364fdd86c2692f39f7c7_2_478x500.png\" alt=\"Qinsp\" data-base62-sha1=\"hXahHjuZ32kj8fAKlnfMReYA6Y7\" width=\"478\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7dd51e05b9298b901156364fdd86c2692f39f7c7_2_478x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7dd51e05b9298b901156364fdd86c2692f39f7c7_2_717x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/d/7dd51e05b9298b901156364fdd86c2692f39f7c7.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F6F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Qinsp</span><span class=\"informations\">792×827 25.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Tried too many options in client script based on inputs from gemini ai but no outcome. can some please suggest their inputs ?</p>",
